      "created_at": "2015-06-14T02:25:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Love the sentinel tourney you had today even though I couldn't come. Had a hot date.</p><p>i am just hoping you guys can hold a few more events this summer that's not at a con. few ideas:</p><p>dice hate me day - come play the dice hate me games for those who want to demo some of them.</p><p>sentienls days - come play sentinels and just have fun</p><p>new game demo day - with all the games in the work, may be fun to have a day people can come and demo some of them so we know what games we want to get if we miss the kickstarters</p><p>whatever launch day - just a launch day event for any new product you may get in over the summer.</p><p>i don't care I just want to come to St. Louis and play games day - self explanatory&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
